cols-2\"><article id=\"wedding-calc\" class=\"flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg text-accent-text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calculator h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"16\" height=\"20\" x=\"4\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"14\" y2=\"18\"></line><path d=\"M16 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 18h.01\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium border-success-border bg-success-bg text-success-fg\">Đang mở</span></div><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-text\">Bảng tính đám cưới</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Ước tính tổng chi phí, số bàn chính thức kèm dự phòng, chi phí thực đơn theo giá mâm và số lượt mừng cần để hòa vốn.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent px-5 text-xs font-semibold text-accent-fg transition-colors hover:bg-accent-hover focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring sm:text-sm\" href=\"/cong-cu/bang-tinh-dam-cuoi\"><span>Mở bảng tính</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article id=\"lunar-converter\" class=\"flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg text-accent-text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium border-success-border bg-success-bg text-success-fg\">Đang mở</span></div><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-text\">Đổi âm lịch</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Đổi ngày dương sang âm lịch và ngược lại (1900–2100), hiển thị can chi năm, tháng, ngày theo múi giờ Việt Nam.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent px-5 text-xs font-semibold text-accent-fg transition-colors hover:bg-accent-hover focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring sm:text-sm\" href=\"/cong-cu/doi-am-lich\"><span>Mở công cụ</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article></section><section class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\"><div class=\"max-w-xl\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-text\">Sẵn sàng tạo thiệp cưới cá nhân hóa tên từng khách?</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Khởi tạo thiệp miễn phí cho 20 khách đầu tiên, tự động tổng hợp xác nhận tham dự và chế độ ăn ngay trong Dashboard.</p></div><a class=\"inline-flex h-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-fg transition-colors hover:bg-accent-hover focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring\" href=\"/tao-thiep\"><span>Tạo thiệp miễn phí</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section></main><div class=\"border-t border-border print:hidden\"><footer class=\"bg-bg py-8 text-text-muted\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-start justify-between gap-4 px-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:px-6\"><div><a class=\"font-display text-xl font-semibold text-accent-text focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring sm:text-2xl\" href=\"/\">Inviwedd</a><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-text-muted\">© 2026 Inviwedd. Bảo lưu mọi quyền.</p></div><nav aria-label=\"Liên kết công cụ, pháp lý và liên hệ\" class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm\"><a class=\"text-text transition-colors hover:text-accent-text focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring\" href=\"/cong-cu\">Công cụ</a><a class=\"text-text transition-colors hover:text-accent-text focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring\" href=\"/chinh-sach-bao-ma